### Geometry and source of one lead thickness of a lead x energy scan: lead layer leadT cm,
### seed from the scan definition, ROOT output with /EventFilter leadScanFilter into leadScanDir,
### EXPACS muons from the plane of half size leadScanHalfXY cm at z = leadScanPlaneZ cm with
### zenith < 75 deg (2 x 2 m at 42 cm, filter 2, in the 0-20 cm scans). Used by
### lead_energy_scan_points_t.mac and lead_energy_scan_check_t.mac.

/tof/det/leadThickness {leadT} cm
/update
/control/add leadScanSeed {leadScanSeed0} {leadT}
/gun/seed {leadScanSeed}

/OutputFormat 1
/EventFilter {leadScanFilter}
/OutputDirectory {leadScanDir}
/GeneralParticleSource 2
/tof/cosmic/model expacs
/tof/cosmic/species mu+ mu-
/tof/cosmic/angular all 2 mu+ guan mu- guan
/tof/cosmic/planeCenter 0 0 {leadScanPlaneZ} cm
/tof/cosmic/halfX {leadScanHalfXY} cm
/tof/cosmic/halfY {leadScanHalfXY} cm
/tof/cosmic/thetaMax 75 deg
